node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
out/
# Plan pages are rebuilt by make_plan.py; plan/decisions.md stays in the repo.
**/plan/index.html
**/plan/est/
**/plan/frames/
**/plan/voice/
**/plan/stills/
# Downloaded and conformed real material (often copyrighted): research/assets.md records how to fetch it again.
**/raw/
**/scenes/_shared/opening/
# HyperFrames: shot.js is written from the timeline; fonts and GSAP are copied in by scripts/hyperframes/setup.sh
**/scenes/*/shot.js
**/scenes/_shared/fonts/
**/scenes/_shared/vendor/
# Render cache records (capture_frames.mjs, render_shot.sh)
*.inputs.json
*.inputs.sha256
# HyperFrames scratch written next to the clip while it renders
**/scenes/*/.*.hf-transaction-*/
**/scenes/*/work-*-*/
# Stills that render_shot.sh --stills-only writes next to the clip
**/scenes/*/stills/
